  "question": {
    "text": "A vertical tower subtends an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at a point on the same level as the foot of the tower. On moving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> further from the first point in line with the tower, it subtends an angle of <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at the point. If the height of the tower is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mrow><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(in meters)&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0030_b0a10d8e16cf.png\" style=\"width: 307px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8728;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8728;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>H</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>H</mi><mrow><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
